{"page_id": "synth_copies-sv30780e9b-p1", "markdown": "VICOR\n\nFeatures • DC input range: 100 - 200 V • Encapsulated circuitry for shock and vibration resistance • Extended temperature range (-55 to +100°C) • Input surge withstand: 250 V for 100 ms • DC output: 3.3 - 48 V • Programmable output: 10 to 110% • Regulation: +0.2% no load to full load • Efficiency: Up to 88% • Maximum operating temp: 100°C, full load • Power density up to 91 W per cubic inch • Height above board: 0.43 in. (10,9 mm) • Parallelable, with N+M fault tolerance • Low noise ZCS/ZVS architecture • RoHS Compliant (with F or G pin option) • Agency approvals pending\n\nProduct Overview These DC-DC converters use and advanced power processor and packaging technologies to provide the performance, flexibility, reliability and cost effectiveness of a mature power component. High frequency ZCS/ZVS switching provides high power density with low noise and high efficiency.\n\nApplications Communications, control systems, medical, transportation, defense and aerospace.\n\nPart Numbering e.g. V150C12C150BL\n\nData Sheet 150V Input Micro Family DC-DC Converter Module\n\nRoHS\n\nCE\n\nShown actual size: 2.28 x 1.45 x 0.5 in 57,9 × 36,8 × 12,7 mm\n\nNotes\n\nAbsolute Maximum Ratings\n\nParameter +In to -In voltage PC to -In voltage PR to -In voltage SC to -Out voltage -Sense to -Out voltage Isolation voltage\n\nin to out\n\nin to base\n\nout to base\n\nOperating Temperature\n\nStorage Temperature\n\nPin soldering temperature\n\nMounting torque\n\nRating -0.5 to +260\n\n-0.5 to +7.0\n\n-0.5 to +7.0\n\n-0.5 to +1.5\n\n1.0\n\n3000 1500\n\n500\n\n-55 to +100\n\n-65 to +125 500(260) 750(390) 5 (0.57)\n\nUnit\n\nVdc\n\nVdc Vdc\n\nVdc Vdc\n\nVrms Vrms\n\nVrms\n\n°C\n\n°C\n\n°F（°C） °F (°C) in-Ibs (N-m)\n\nTest voltage Test voltage lest voltage M-Grade\n\nM-Grade\n\n<5 sec; wave solder\n\n<7 sec; hand solder\n\n6 each\n\nOutput Voltage 3V3 =3.3 V 5 = 5V 8 =8 V 12 = 12 V 15 = 15 V 24 = 24 V 28=28V 36 = 36 V 48 = 48 V\n\n